# 📊 Linux System Monitoring & Visualization using Prometheus and Grafana

## 📌 Project Overview

This project implements a containerized monitoring solution using **Prometheus, Grafana, and Node Exporter** with Docker Compose.

Prometheus collects system metrics, Node Exporter exposes Linux system-level metrics, and Grafana visualizes the collected data through interactive dashboards.

The project demonstrates practical knowledge of monitoring, observability, Docker containerization, and infrastructure management.

## 🛠️ Technologies Used

- **Docker** – Containerization
- **Docker Compose** – Multi-container orchestration
- **Prometheus** – Metrics collection and monitoring
- **Node Exporter** – Linux system metrics exporter
- **Grafana** – Data visualization and dashboards
- **Linux (Ubuntu / WSL)** – Operating environment

## 🏗️ Architecture

```text
          Linux System (Ubuntu / WSL)
                     |
